$ varag bench make-error-clue --help
# started 2026-10-19T23:20:27.920+00:00
Usage: varag bench make-error-clue [OPTIONS] CONCEPT

  Run the snippet in the target environment, capture its traceback, and write
  clues/<target>_error.txt. Refuses a traceback that names no exclusive
  symbol, keyword, rejected value or migration message.

Options:
  --target [old|new]              The environment the snippet fails in.
                                  [required]
  --snippet FILE                  The author's failing snippet (5 to 15 lines
                                  using the other version's API).  [required]
  --overlap [on_target|off_target]
                                  [default: off_target]
  --help                          Show this message and exit.
